1. PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD)
Product name (working)

ForgeOS
(you can rename later, this just frames thinking)

Core problem

You (and builders like you) have:

too many ideas
unclear priorities
fragmented execution
weak connection between planning → coding → shipping

Current tools:

Notion = storage
Jira = pain
GitHub = execution only
AI tools = disconnected

👉 Result: ideas don’t turn into shipped products fast enough

Solution

A single system that:

captures ideas
turns them into structured projects
generates execution plans
connects directly to GitHub
orchestrates Claude/Codex for building
shows exactly what to do next
Target user (v1)
Solo dev / indie hacker
AI-native builder
Uses GitHub
Uses Claude/Codex
Wants speed > process
Core use cases
1. Capture idea

→ becomes structured idea
→ AI enriches
→ score it
→ convert to project

2. Plan product

→ generate MVP roadmap
→ create tasks
→ define specs

3. Execute

→ pick task
→ generate Claude prompt
→ open in Claude Code
→ code
→ push → PR

4. Ship

→ track PR
→ see status
→ merge
→ mark tasks done

5. Improve

→ see bottlenecks
→ get suggestions
→ iterate

Core principles
Action > organization
Everything leads to next step
AI is embedded, not bolted on
GitHub is the source of truth for code
Minimal friction always
